{"format":"coupole-schema/1","id":"architecture_solaire","taille":[680,340],"titre":{"fr":"Architecture solaire passive","en":"Passive solar architecture"},"alt":{"fr":"À 45° de latitude Nord, le Soleil de midi culmine à ≈ 68° au solstice d'été et à ≈ 22° au solstice d'hiver : un avant-toit bien dimensionné ombrage la baie vitrée orientée au sud en été et laisse entrer le Soleil en hiver.","en":"At 45° north latitude the noon Sun culminates at ≈ 68° at the summer solstice and ≈ 22° at the winter solstice: a well-sized overhang shades the south-facing window in summer and lets the Sun in in winter."},"elements":[{"t":"ligne","p":[[40,280],[640,280]],"style":{"trait":"terre","fond":null,"ep":3}},{"t":"rect","p":[180,130],"l":220,"h":150,"rayon":0,"style":{"trait":"trait","fond":"fond2","ep":1.5}},{"t":"poly","p":[[170,130],[290,70],[440,130]],"ferme":true,"style":{"trait":"trait","fond":"lune","ep":1.5}},{"t":"rect","p":[390,160],"l":10,"h":100,"rayon":0,"style":{"trait":"trait","fond":"eau","ep":1,"opacite":0.6}},{"t":"ligne","p":[[400,130],[470,130]],"style":{"trait":"trait","fond":null,"ep":4}},{"t":"texte","p":[540,300],"txt":{"fr":"sud →","en":"south →"},"taille":12,"ancre":"m","base":"milieu","couleur":"fin"},{"t":"ligne","p":[[451.45,29.8],[400,160]],"style":{"trait":"chaud","fond":null,"ep":2,"fleche":"fin"}},{"t":"texte","p":[445.45,19.8],"txt":{"fr":"été : 68°","en":"summer: 68°"},"taille":12,"ancre":"d","base":"milieu","couleur":"chaud"},{"t":"ligne","p":[[623.21,161.81],[400,250]],"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":2,"fleche":"fin"}},{"t":"texte","p":[617.21,151.81],"txt":{"fr":"hiver : 22°","en":"winter: 22°"},"taille":12,"ancre":"d","base":"milieu","couleur":"accent2"}],"vue":[0.0,0.0,680.0,340.0]}